{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n こんばんは\n \n \n 今日も１日お疲れ様です。\n \n \n この間マネージャーさんの\n 素敵なカメラでちょっと遊びました。‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSE7FQJDWG7G1KNJ8SCY8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSF6J92F5EGB971JM75SK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSG7T45NABB25XXCM9EM1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSH8M0FVG0A966QPR9A9D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 小さい頃からまともに撮るんじゃなくて\n ちょっとカメラで遊びながら撮るのが好きです\n \n \n 特に寄るのが好き。‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n そういえば皆さん、\n 櫻坂の新しいオフィシャルグッズ\n 見てくださりましたか??\n \n \n Tシャツは種類が豊富なので\n すごい迷っちゃいますね。🤔\n \n \n BANのロングスリーブTシャツCの\n ちょこっと映っている髪を見て、\n \n \n 「誰だろう～?」なんてね、\n はぶちゃんと話したりして。\n \n \n 個人的にはシンプルな\n BANのTシャツが好きです🌸\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSJ7NFTX1ZM6G7VB5VKEB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSK8SMA8B4W3B9VTMEMFW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n シンプルだけど、\n 文字の存在感が強くて。\n \n \n 皆さんはどれが気になっていますか??\n \n \n 是非、チェックしてくださいね‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSM9NM73T0B8HQ4G729YX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n みい。             "}],"source":"archive"}